Hi! I'm a software engineer living in Cincinnati, OH. I'm currently working in climate tech on a data sharing platform to make energy data accessible for companies who need it. 

On evenings and weekends, I'm working on my bachelor's in computer science, and my [neovim plugin](https://codeberg.org/trevorhauter/gitportal.nvim) if I can find the time.

I've spent my career in web development, but spend a lot of time thinking about developer tooling, and have recently taken an interest in systems programming. I'm very passionate about high quality open source software and hope to spend more of my time contributing to projects once I finish my degree. 
